WEBVTT

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:22.799
Now listen, yo!

00:00:22.823 --> 00:00:23.900
People put your guns up

00:00:23.924 --> 00:00:25.568
First 'I run dat

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:28.238
Run around and shoot them

00:00:28.262 --> 00:00:30.807
Brand new sound, yes still survival

00:00:30.831 --> 00:00:33.176
Here comes the sound boy, live in this world

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.779
Intelligence, strength, and luck are swirling, flow

00:00:35.803 --> 00:00:38.715
My swelled mind is candid

00:00:38.739 --> 00:00:39.749
One punch to Banner in Savannah

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:41.050
An easy knockout, bam bam bam

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.986
One time for your mind, live through this

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.220
Around the world

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:46.723
It haunts me, the pain of the past

00:00:46.747 --> 00:00:49.526
Around the noble god are borrowed things

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:52.228
When the seed that's sown flowers, whose is it

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:55.165
Live and fire the arrow of faith, more more more

00:00:55.189 --> 00:00:57.700
There is no peace where you're going

00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:00.303
Come on, stand up, don't give up the fight

00:01:00.327 --> 00:01:05.408
Now, yes, this instant, die die die

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:08.077
Big shooter, living fast, blazing

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:10.680
Beat you up, cut it open, break

00:01:10.704 --> 00:01:13.316
Shot shooter, he lived fast, crazy

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:16.019
Adjust your sights at point-blank range, break

00:01:16.043 --> 00:01:18.721
Big shooter, living fast, blazing

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:21.324
Beat you up, cut it open, break

00:01:21.348 --> 00:01:23.960
Shot shooter, he lived fast, crazy

00:01:23.984 --> 00:01:26.885
Adjust your sights at point-blank range, break

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:35.271
--Can you give us more of a hint?
--Okay, write down your answers, now!

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:36.506
What?

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:39.108
If you watch the video closely,
you'll get the answer.

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:41.829
What is...?

00:02:01.822 --> 00:02:04.467
Let's make sure we make it home... all of us.

00:02:04.491 --> 00:02:06.960
Yes, let's do that.

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:15.429
Awesome!

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:26.823
Uh-oh!

00:02:26.847 --> 00:02:29.111
My suit's not here.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.843
What am I gonna do?

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.927
Damn it!

00:02:41.328 --> 00:02:45.308
"I'll Kill You Without a Moment's Hesitation"

00:02:45.332 --> 00:02:47.010
<i>"Plis go eliminate this target now, you bastards. The Suzuki Alien Traits:
Strong, reth eshing, dib. Likes: Binds, sweets. Catchphrase: Ha, ha, ha"</i>

00:02:47.034 --> 00:02:49.279
"Plis go eliminate this target now, vyou bastards. The Suzuki Alien Traits: Strong, retheshing, di 1b.
Likes: Binds, sweets. Catchphrase: Ha, ha, ha!” Go to the foyer one at a time and put on your suits.

00:02:49.303 --> 00:02:50.429
Go to the foyer one at a
time and put on your suits.

00:02:51.772 --> 00:02:55.285
Are you the leader here or something?

00:02:55.309 --> 00:02:57.243
No, I'm not, but...

00:02:59.246 --> 00:03:03.393
Then quit bossing people around.

00:03:03.417 --> 00:03:05.228
You think I'm gonna wear this?

00:03:05.252 --> 00:03:06.845
It's so lame.

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:13.536
It would be better if you put them on.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:18.274
Well, where are we?

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:20.710
Kato...

00:03:20.734 --> 00:03:22.378
I'll tell you after you put them on.

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:24.213
You'll have a better chance of making it home.

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:26.049
Kato, well...

00:03:26.073 --> 00:03:27.768
Please put them on.

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:30.553
Like we said,

00:03:30.577 --> 00:03:33.656
this Yamada Alien stuff doesn't concern us.

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:36.192
It's Suzuki, the Suzuki Alien!

00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:38.995
Now don't go correcting him with a straight face.

00:03:39.019 --> 00:03:41.397
What's more important is my suit...

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:43.499
Kato...

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:45.201
Hey!

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:49.706
You just said these suits can determine
whether we live or die, right?

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:50.974
Yeah...

00:03:50.998 --> 00:03:54.444
You also said that you
aren't the leader here, right?

00:03:54.468 --> 00:03:56.145
What are you getting at?

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:59.482
I have to make sure to get these guys home.

00:03:59.506 --> 00:04:02.840
I'm like their leader, see?

00:04:04.444 --> 00:04:06.923
I could care less about the rest of you,

00:04:06.947 --> 00:04:09.392
but I'll tell you this:

00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:13.129
I'll decide whether these
three wear the suits or not.

00:04:13.153 --> 00:04:15.665
Next time you try to give us orders...

00:04:15.689 --> 00:04:17.333
You'll do what?

00:04:17.357 --> 00:04:21.316
I'll take you out before I do
anything to that Suzuki-whatever.

00:04:23.597 --> 00:04:27.944
Hey, say something to Tetsu!

00:04:27.968 --> 00:04:30.680
I'd like you to tell them to wear them.

00:04:30.704 --> 00:04:32.749
It's not an order;

00:04:32.773 --> 00:04:34.434
it's a request.

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:37.453
Shit...

00:04:37.477 --> 00:04:37.653
"Kato-cha :)"
Shit...

00:04:37.677 --> 00:04:38.303
"Kato-cha :)"

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:48.731
I'll make sure to get you home,
just wait a little while longer.

00:04:48.755 --> 00:04:51.300
Grandma, is this mine?

00:04:51.324 --> 00:04:53.102
Why, it is.

00:04:53.126 --> 00:04:55.638
I guess they have kid's sizes, too.

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:58.041
I hope it's been disinfected.

00:04:58.065 --> 00:05:01.544
Your skin breaks out in rashes easily.

00:05:01.568 --> 00:05:03.764
What are you, stupid?

00:05:07.908 --> 00:05:10.787
I said, I'm not putting this on.

00:05:10.811 --> 00:05:13.823
Yeah, normally no one would.

00:05:13.847 --> 00:05:16.592
What are you saying?
Are you gonna wear it, Tetsu?

00:05:16.616 --> 00:05:19.062
No, it's just...

00:05:19.086 --> 00:05:22.920
What if this isn't a
normal situation? Then what?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.868
What are you, stupid?

00:05:25.892 --> 00:05:27.470
Yeah, you're right.

00:05:27.494 --> 00:05:29.806
Well, I'll leave it up to you guys.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.307
You can do whatever you want.

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:33.810
That's what I was going
to do from the beginning.

00:05:33.834 --> 00:05:35.598
What about you, Tetsu?

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.048
Don't tell me vyou're gonna put it on.

00:05:39.072 --> 00:05:40.283
No, I'm not.

00:05:40.307 --> 00:05:42.708
Of course not.

00:05:52.719 --> 00:05:53.963
So you're not gonna put it on?

00:05:53.987 --> 00:05:56.866
I wouldn't be caught dead
outside in one of these.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:59.869
Before long, you'll have to leave this
place whether you want to or not.

00:05:59.893 --> 00:06:03.272
And you'll have to change your
clothes whether you like it or not.

00:06:03.296 --> 00:06:06.275
I can't put it on. It's too embarrassing.

00:06:06.299 --> 00:06:09.212
Hey, that busty babe's gonna change clothes.

00:06:09.236 --> 00:06:11.261
That's what it looks like.

00:06:14.641 --> 00:06:16.519
Where are you going?

00:06:16.543 --> 00:06:18.054
You can't go outside.

00:06:18.078 --> 00:06:19.655
Huh? To the can.

00:06:19.679 --> 00:06:21.807
Yeah, to take a shit.

00:06:24.451 --> 00:06:27.163
Oh, really?

00:06:27.187 --> 00:06:29.212
Well, then, guess I'll go, too.

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.503
Please... Please put them on.

00:06:33.527 --> 00:06:35.638
I don't know about my grandson,

00:06:35.662 --> 00:06:38.290
but |, for one, couldn't possibly wear such a...

00:06:57.117 --> 00:06:59.313
I can't hold it any longer...

00:07:05.859 --> 00:07:09.005
What's with this? It's so tight.

00:07:09.029 --> 00:07:10.929
They're huge!

00:07:14.134 --> 00:07:16.846
You don't have to put that on.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.582
--Right, guys?
--It's okay to put it on...

00:07:19.606 --> 00:07:22.132
...after we're done with you.

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:27.223
It appears as though the suits
are made to fit each person.

00:07:27.247 --> 00:07:30.342
--But...
--Hey, Kato.

00:07:31.384 --> 00:07:33.930
Well, actually, I...

00:07:33.954 --> 00:07:35.979
Is something wrong, Kei?

00:07:39.426 --> 00:07:41.304
Those guys...

00:07:41.328 --> 00:07:43.092
Hey, Kato!

00:07:47.167 --> 00:07:49.712
What the...?!

00:07:49.736 --> 00:07:52.148
Hey!

00:07:52.172 --> 00:07:54.116
Not again!

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:57.853
Oh, that scared the shit out
of me! What's with this dog?!

00:07:57.877 --> 00:08:00.723
I wonder if he was owned by
a working girl or something?

00:08:00.747 --> 00:08:03.826
That turns me oh even more...

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.261
Tetsu!

00:08:05.285 --> 00:08:06.729
Knock it off.

00:08:06.753 --> 00:08:08.721
Why should we?

00:08:10.557 --> 00:08:12.868
Get lost, Mr. I-Have-a-Wife!

00:08:12.892 --> 00:08:15.020
That has nothing to do with this.

00:08:17.597 --> 00:08:21.056
It doesn't matter whether I have a wife or not.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.773
Now's not the time to be doing stuff like this.

00:08:38.485 --> 00:08:41.648
Wow, Kishimoto's buck-naked!

00:08:42.656 --> 00:08:44.066
You've gotta be kiddin' me!

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:47.436
Tetsu, you actually believe
this stuff about the Sato Alien?

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.038
It's Suzuki.

00:08:49.062 --> 00:08:51.173
Kato...

00:08:51.197 --> 00:08:55.964
Tetsu, why don't you just give up
acting like our leader already?!

00:08:57.671 --> 00:09:01.284
Don't believe this shit! Get real!

00:09:01.308 --> 00:09:04.520
I didn't say I did, but...

00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:06.022
When we get home,

00:09:06.046 --> 00:09:09.482
| better not catch you riding
in front of us again, punk!

00:09:28.134 --> 00:09:30.613
It's okay for us to wear
clothes on top of this, right?

00:09:30.637 --> 00:09:32.127
Yeah...

00:09:35.709 --> 00:09:38.054
Tetsu, what are you, stupid?

00:09:38.078 --> 00:09:39.922
Let him do what he wants.

00:09:39.946 --> 00:09:42.058
Forget him.

00:09:42.082 --> 00:09:43.559
Oh, shit...

00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:45.661
Everyone's got them on.

00:09:45.685 --> 00:09:49.713
At this rate, I'm gonna die.

00:09:52.092 --> 00:09:54.136
What am I gonna do?

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:56.128
Think...

00:10:01.201 --> 00:10:02.712
No way...

00:10:02.736 --> 00:10:04.864
Don't tell me you took it home?

00:10:06.673 --> 00:10:09.836
That's so lame! What a lame-o!

00:10:11.878 --> 00:10:13.856
Kei...

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:18.613
All right, it's for sure, one man dead.

00:10:41.307 --> 00:10:43.452
Hey, it happened again!

00:10:43.476 --> 00:10:44.620
What?

00:10:44.644 --> 00:10:47.841
You mean the ghost that
steals the capsule candy?

00:10:49.182 --> 00:10:51.560
Look...

00:10:51.584 --> 00:10:54.363
You're always pinching them
for yourself, aren't you?

00:10:54.387 --> 00:10:57.700
I have no interest in either
the candy or the prizes.

00:10:57.724 --> 00:11:00.102
It's got to be a ghost or something.

00:11:00.126 --> 00:11:01.855
Whatever you say...

00:11:03.663 --> 00:11:06.633
"Bike Monthly"

00:11:08.201 --> 00:11:09.712
I wonder if it's broken?

00:11:09.736 --> 00:11:11.670
No, I'm telling you, it's...

00:11:12.105 --> 00:11:13.470
"Color Copies 100 yen"

00:11:14.274 --> 00:11:16.333
Look, over there!

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:18.821
It's from the last customer, right?

00:11:18.845 --> 00:11:21.590
Go on and ring it up.

00:11:21.614 --> 00:11:24.126
What kind of ghost would
pay for his stuff and leave?

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:27.347
I'm telling you, it's definitely a ghost!

00:11:29.289 --> 00:11:32.350
"Monday" "Watermelon”
"Refreshing” "AAO!"

00:11:44.304 --> 00:11:45.981
Kei...

00:11:46.005 --> 00:11:47.905
Your suit...

00:11:52.912 --> 00:11:55.024
I forgot it.

00:11:55.048 --> 00:11:58.093
--You gotta be kiddin' me!
--He's crying!

00:11:58.117 --> 00:12:01.063
Maybe you'd better put them on.

00:12:01.087 --> 00:12:04.318
Shut up! Like we'd wear those!

00:12:06.359 --> 00:12:09.805
Since it's come down to this,
I should grab their suits.

00:12:09.829 --> 00:12:11.240
You've got to be joking!

00:12:11.264 --> 00:12:14.076
Pretty soon, people will start
being transported now, won't they?

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:17.913
--Kurono...
--Why didn't you say anything earlier?

00:12:17.937 --> 00:12:20.804
I tried to tell you many times!

00:12:21.908 --> 00:12:23.719
Where are you going?

00:12:23.743 --> 00:12:26.355
This time, I really am going to take a leak.

00:12:26.379 --> 00:12:28.057
Alf right...

00:12:28.081 --> 00:12:30.092
I can go for it now.

00:12:30.116 --> 00:12:32.175
Isn't there something that can be done?

00:12:34.954 --> 00:12:36.752
I don't know.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.055
Just a little bit more...

00:12:43.229 --> 00:12:46.642
--Crap...
--That's theft!

00:12:46.666 --> 00:12:50.613
Hey, you! What do you think
you're doing stealing from me?

00:12:50.637 --> 00:12:53.015
But you're not going to wear it, right?

00:12:53.039 --> 00:12:58.120
So what if I'm not?! Does that
mean it's okay for you to swipe it?

00:12:58.144 --> 00:13:00.923
That's probably how it would turn out.

00:13:00.947 --> 00:13:03.592
Just as I thought, it'd be too hard to steal one.

00:13:03.616 --> 00:13:06.729
Damn it! I'm in deep trouble now.

00:13:06.753 --> 00:13:09.965
Won't you lend yours to Kei?

00:13:09.989 --> 00:13:13.269
What? What the hell are
you jabbering about, huh?

00:13:13.293 --> 00:13:15.204
Kato...

00:13:15.228 --> 00:13:16.939
If you aren't going to wear it,
there's nothing I can do about it.

00:13:16.963 --> 00:13:19.608
So at the very least,
I'd like you to lend him yours.

00:13:19.632 --> 00:13:22.444
Like hell! This is mine.

00:13:22.468 --> 00:13:24.179
Let him borrow it, Haruya.

00:13:24.203 --> 00:13:26.148
You just shut your mouth!

00:13:26.172 --> 00:13:28.384
Whether I decide to
wear it or not, it's still mine.

00:13:28.408 --> 00:13:29.985
Like hell I'll let him borrow it!

00:13:30.009 --> 00:13:32.637
--But...
--It's no use.

00:13:33.780 --> 00:13:37.426
Another person's suit is only a set of clothes.

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:41.764
If that's the case, then I'm dead meat after all.

00:13:41.788 --> 00:13:43.165
There's got to be something...

00:13:43.189 --> 00:13:45.234
Some way Kei can survive.

00:13:45.258 --> 00:13:48.537
Idiot! Like I'd tell you any more than that!

00:13:48.561 --> 00:13:51.740
Is there?! Talk! C'mon, tell me!

00:13:51.764 --> 00:13:54.734
It's "Tell me, please,” isn't it?

00:13:57.537 --> 00:13:59.682
Tell me, please.

00:13:59.706 --> 00:14:01.917
I dunno, should I?

00:14:01.941 --> 00:14:04.486
Quit jerking me around, you little...! Talk!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:07.056
--Die with some dignity!
--Why, you...!

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:10.744
You're dead! Each and every one of you!

00:14:17.991 --> 00:14:20.469
Or something like that.

00:14:20.493 --> 00:14:22.393
Just kidding!

00:14:23.563 --> 00:14:25.541
You little brat!

00:14:25.565 --> 00:14:27.610
Let go of me, you!

00:14:27.634 --> 00:14:29.345
Ow!

00:14:29.369 --> 00:14:31.914
What the hell are you?!

00:14:31.938 --> 00:14:34.350
You guys really piss me off.

00:14:34.374 --> 00:14:36.452
Even if the likes of you were dead,

00:14:36.476 --> 00:14:40.522
it'd have absolutely no
bearing on the world at large.

00:14:40.546 --> 00:14:44.994
<i>So, there's no point in carrying on
about whether you'll live or die.</i>

00:14:45.018 --> 00:14:46.395
No point at all!

00:14:46.419 --> 00:14:49.098
So, you're saying you're dead, too?

00:14:49.122 --> 00:14:50.733
I'm not going to tell you.

00:14:50.757 --> 00:14:53.135
The people here aren't your teammates,

00:14:53.159 --> 00:14:56.005
so there's no need for a leader.

00:14:56.029 --> 00:14:58.207
We're all rivals...

00:14:58.231 --> 00:15:00.876
Rivals competing for survival.

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:04.613
"Let's all make it back?"
Don't give me that crap.

00:15:04.637 --> 00:15:06.696
You hypocrite.

00:15:07.874 --> 00:15:11.353
Last time you head-butted
a yakuza, didn't you?

00:15:11.377 --> 00:15:14.890
Why would someone who wants us all
to make it back strong-arm people?

00:15:14.914 --> 00:15:16.358
Gimme a break!

00:15:16.382 --> 00:15:19.995
They call stuff like that violent impulses.

00:15:20.019 --> 00:15:22.364
Have a discussion. A discussion.

00:15:22.388 --> 00:15:24.933
Not head-butting.

00:15:24.957 --> 00:15:26.935
And you there, Miss Melons!

00:15:26.959 --> 00:15:28.303
Yeah, what?

00:15:28.327 --> 00:15:30.472
"Isn't there something that can be done?”

00:15:30.496 --> 00:15:32.741
That really got my goat.

00:15:32.765 --> 00:15:33.942
All you've got is a huge rack.

00:15:33.966 --> 00:15:37.046
Otherwise, you're as helpless
as a newborn, aren't you?

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:41.517
You mean to tell me a woman like
that can go bossing people around?

00:15:41.541 --> 00:15:44.820
Even though you can't do
anything for yourself? Huh?

00:15:44.844 --> 00:15:50.492
If you getin a pinch, you think he'll
get you out of it somehow, don't you?

00:15:50.516 --> 00:15:52.484
Don't you?

00:15:53.486 --> 00:15:55.716
Hey, Mr. Hard-on!

00:15:56.723 --> 00:15:58.934
Are you that scared of dying?

00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:01.870
You shouldn't be crying. It's disgraceful!

00:16:01.894 --> 00:16:05.174
Before, I thought you had
a little bit of potential,

00:16:05.198 --> 00:16:06.375
but I take it back!

00:16:06.399 --> 00:16:09.511
You ought to be the first to die!

00:16:09.535 --> 00:16:11.246
So what if I was scared?

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.615
I'm telling you, it's disgraceful.

00:16:13.639 --> 00:16:15.869
That kind of stuff doesn't faze me.

00:16:18.611 --> 00:16:21.090
Hey, kid! Stop bawling!

00:16:21.114 --> 00:16:24.982
I'm sorry, could you please
be a little more quiet?

00:16:26.219 --> 00:16:29.064
You two are on the shakiest ground.

00:16:29.088 --> 00:16:31.467
You have almost no chance of survival.

00:16:31.491 --> 00:16:33.135
Oh, dear...

00:16:33.159 --> 00:16:34.970
You're just like Miss Melons here.

00:16:34.994 --> 00:16:38.607
You'll die for sure unless
you rely on someone else.

00:16:38.631 --> 00:16:40.175
Who'll you depend on?

00:16:40.199 --> 00:16:42.578
It's not going to be me.

00:16:42.602 --> 00:16:44.246
Oh, and another thing.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:48.650
You spoil your grandchild
like that to satisfy yourself.

00:16:48.674 --> 00:16:52.821
Is it okay to warp his personality
just because he's adorable? Huh?

00:16:52.845 --> 00:16:55.057
He won't grow up to be a respectable adult.

00:16:55.081 --> 00:16:58.494
But by that time you'll probably be dead.

00:16:58.518 --> 00:17:02.731
But that doesn't mean that it's okay to
release a warped fish into society, does it?

00:17:02.755 --> 00:17:05.667
Am lwrong? Am I?

00:17:05.691 --> 00:17:07.903
Honestly, this isn't even funny!

00:17:07.927 --> 00:17:11.006
And then we've got the bikers,
all fighting like idiots over who's the boss.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:12.641
What?

00:17:12.665 --> 00:17:14.443
You're just a bunch of bikers.

00:17:14.467 --> 00:17:17.546
The garbage of society. Garbage.

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:22.384
But you have to go and bring
this macho crap into it.

00:17:22.408 --> 00:17:25.187
A leader of garbage, my ass!

00:17:25.211 --> 00:17:27.656
You garbage!

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:31.360
And you, I bet you're the type
the girls squeal about, aren't you?

00:17:31.384 --> 00:17:36.098
Your kind are all a bunch of dimwits.

00:17:36.122 --> 00:17:38.600
Have you heard of the web and websites?

00:17:38.624 --> 00:17:42.337
Have you ever used a cell phone for stuff
besides text messages asking women out?

00:17:42.361 --> 00:17:44.039
Yeah, I know what you're talking about.

00:17:44.063 --> 00:17:45.374
Oh, really?

00:17:45.398 --> 00:17:47.509
Well, let me ask you this.

00:17:47.533 --> 00:17:50.512
When you read a newspaper,
where do you start?

00:17:50.536 --> 00:17:52.014
From the TV listings.

00:17:52.038 --> 00:17:53.715
What are you, stupid?

00:17:53.739 --> 00:17:55.784
You've got it all backwards!

00:17:55.808 --> 00:17:57.920
But just by reading the newspaper,

00:17:57.944 --> 00:17:59.388
you're probably better off
than those biker thugs

00:17:59.412 --> 00:18:03.315
who only use ridiculous word
combinations because they sound cool.

00:18:19.265 --> 00:18:21.977
--Did it fire?
--Did you hit him?

00:18:22.001 --> 00:18:23.278
I don't know.

00:18:23.302 --> 00:18:25.669
It only made a sound.

00:18:28.174 --> 00:18:30.652
It doesn't matter whether
a bullet comes out or not!

00:18:30.676 --> 00:18:32.354
You just had to go and shoot your mouth off!

00:18:32.378 --> 00:18:34.089
--Stop!
--That's...

00:18:34.113 --> 00:18:35.791
The real thing?

00:18:35.815 --> 00:18:37.579
'I kill you!

00:18:41.587 --> 00:18:44.099
What are you doing pointing a gun at me?

00:18:44.123 --> 00:18:45.968
Huh?!

00:18:45.992 --> 00:18:48.871
So they are toys after all.

00:18:48.895 --> 00:18:50.973
No, this is...

00:18:50.997 --> 00:18:53.675
There's a time lag!

00:18:53.699 --> 00:18:55.189
Huh?

00:18:56.502 --> 00:18:59.733
Why, you... Don't you mess with the boys!

00:19:11.617 --> 00:19:14.863
Listen up, you idiots.

00:19:14.887 --> 00:19:17.799
If any of you point a gun at me, I'll kill
you without a moment's hesitation.

00:19:17.823 --> 00:19:20.302
You got that? If any of you point a gun at me,

00:19:20.326 --> 00:19:22.471
I'll kill you without a moment's hesitation!

00:19:22.495 --> 00:19:25.362
Imprint that on your tiny brains!

00:19:26.432 --> 00:19:31.346
And the rest of you, anyone who slows
me down, I'll kill you with no remorse.

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:33.304
Especially you.

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:37.319
See? She's totally relying on you.

00:19:37.343 --> 00:19:39.321
You were shot.

00:19:39.345 --> 00:19:41.256
How come nothing happened to you?

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.325
I'm not answering any more questions.

00:19:43.349 --> 00:19:44.860
Is it because of your suit?

00:19:44.884 --> 00:19:45.594
Gantz! Quit draggin your feet!

00:19:45.618 --> 00:19:47.930
